  "body": "Because you have to provide a realm in order to [create a new object implementing an interface](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#new), there's no way to create platform objects from a language-independent specification. The language-independent definition of [Interfaces](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-interfaces) or [Objects implementing interfaces](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-objects) should mention this and link to the text we want specs to cite when creating objects.",
